      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s wording that client characteristics are examined “to understand differences in treatment course or outcomes” is broader than what the packet supports. The packet specifically investigates predictors of “dropout from the service Prompt Mental Health Care (PMHC).”",
        "The definition lists examples “such as age, education, employment, social support, functioning, and symptom severity,” which are supported by the packet; however, because the definition adds the unverified general purpose about treatment course/outcomes (not specifically dropout), the substantive claim is not fully supported."
